    "m_ObjectId": "64dad8d24e074774b5e553b71573ab36",
    "m_Title": "",
    "m_Content": "The problem is the surface depth. It is very hard to get a camera-independent surface depth in a shader. For now, I've simply removed them all; it's not really necessary, except to have foam at the edges of the water. We can look into that later.",
